  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.4.1 — Stability and performance patch. AJAX request sequencing (AbortController + monotonic id) prevents stale-response overwrites. Cell-edit listener cleanup eliminates a leak. Render hot paths cached: frozen-offset walks (O(n²)→O(n)), visible-column refilters, selection refresh via row-index Map, search regex, sort comparator. Virtual scroll skips re-render when scrolling within the same window slice. State persistence debounced (200 ms) with a new flushState() helper. 7 new tests cover race conditions, listener hygiene, debounce, locale validation, and double-destroy.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Bootstrap 5 data grid (vanilla JS, TypeScript, less than 15 KB gzipped).",
